# Whitelist (2026-10-01): code, configs, manifests/lists, training logs, checkpoints, results, ONNX exports.
# Never audio, archives, raw downloads or environments (licences forbid redistributing several corpora).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/notebooks/
!/data/
/data/*
